Comparison of the physical Decipher scan and five Players Committee image versions of [[Captain Needa]]. Components, left to right, top to bottom:
* [[:File:Dagobah-D-captainneeda-hires.webp|Physical Decipher scan]].
* [[:File:Dagobah-D-Captain-Needa-PC-gallery-20071216200322.gif|PC gallery: captured 16 Dec 2007]].
* [[:File:Dagobah-D-Captain-Needa-June-2017-partial.png|PC partial: June 2017 edition]].
* [[:File:Dagobah-D-captainneeda-E-2018-07-08.gif|PC full: 8 July 2018 import]].
* [[:File:Dagobah-D-Captain-Needa-PC-E2-2022-12-23.png|PC full: record 23 Dec 2022]].
* [[:File:Dagobah-D-captainneeda.gif|PC full: record 19 Feb 2023]].

The 2007 source is the [https://web.archive.org/web/20071216200322id_/http://www.swccgpc.com/cards/dagobah/ds/captainneeda.gif PC gallery capture]. The partial comes from [[:File:PC-Decipher-Errata-June-2017.pdf]], PDF page 2. Later full faces are recorded in the PC Holotable repository in July 2018, December 2022 and February 2023; those records are not established first publication dates. The physical scan retains its original [[Strangewayes|strangewayes]] credit and TIFF provenance on its File page.

Pinned full-image sources:
* [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/holotable/022435b7929e4de26dafbcb1de2ec1d6d04d2153/Images-HT/starwars/Dagobah-Dark/large/captainneeda.gif July 2018 repository import].
* [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/holotable/8690453b331b89dd6111d91f82829fbce8818cad/Images-HT/starwars/Dagobah-Dark/hires/captainneeda.png December 2022 PNG].
* [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/holotable/68f360e2267b93314bec3b27e3797d5b355171d8/Images-HT/starwars/Dagobah-Dark/hires/captainneeda.png February 2023 PNG].
The final two panels use those PNGs; each has identical decoded RGBA pixels to its linked Wiki face, although the file encodings differ.

Only proportional resizing and labelled placement on a white canvas were used; source text and marks remain unchanged. The partial is shown as published, without invented artwork or upper fields. Comparison SHA-256 <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-all;">8f4964004a722ef6a91c92f8b036610f841efab741ce7410ffa29f6803bf759a</code>.

[[Category:Card images]]

== Component provenance ==
This is a Wiki comparison composite assembled by Memory Core ChatGPT; it is not a PC-published sheet. The compositor supplied the labels and arrangement, not the underlying card artwork.
* Physical card panel: [https://wiki.swccg.com/images/a/ae/Dagobah-D-captainneeda-hires.webp exact Wiki WebP reused], [[:File:Dagobah-D-captainneeda-hires.webp|credited scan description]]. Upstream source: [https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B8qrn2aDKgPeMzE2WXhQVWloYVE/view Captain Needa.tif], member <code>Dagobah/Dagobah Dark/Captain Needa.tif</code> in strangewayes’ HiRez collection; this panel reuses the converted WebP, rather than claiming a fresh TIFF download.
* June 2017 panel: [[Media:PC-Decipher-Errata-June-2017.pdf|complete official source PDF]], [[:File:PC-Decipher-Errata-June-2017.pdf|document identity]], PDF page 2, Captain Needa panel; rectangle <code>(398,361,577,445)</code> points, rasterized at 3 pixels/point. The cover says “Official text as of June 1, 2017”; its edition date is not an established publication day.
* December 2007 gallery and the three later Git image panels: direct immutable replay/full-commit image links in the source list above. Internal Git members are <code>Images-HT/starwars/Dagobah-Dark/large/captainneeda.gif</code> (2018) and <code>Images-HT/starwars/Dagobah-Dark/hires/captainneeda.png</code> (2022 and 2023). Each complete source is linked; no installer membership is asserted.
All six panels use their complete image or documented published partial, proportionally resized on the labelled canvas. Original source bytes and native-resolution images remain separately downloadable from those links.